I left out the enrichment fetch. This node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`. A call to `https://metadata.internal.example/enrich` needs an `http-client` import that the node doesn't have, and it would send untrusted feed text to an external host. If you want enrichment, it needs a separate grant with an allowlisted `http-client` handle, and that's a decision for the graph owner.

